cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this firmware, please cite the paper listed in preferred-citation."
title: "Droplet Energy Harvesting Panel: Wireless Smoke/Temperature Sensor Firmware"
abstract: >-
  Firmware for a self-powered wireless smoke/temperature sensor node based on
  the TI CC430F5137, an internal temperature sensor, and a MAX30105 optical
  smoke sensor. A CC430F6137 receiver forwards the measurements over UART to
  VOFA+. Two build configurations provide either a 3-byte temperature + smoke
  alarm packet or a 5-byte raw smoke + temperature packet.
